<title>USA: NOPA to release weekly oilseed crush report Monday.</title>
<headline>NOPA to release weekly oilseed crush report Monday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Oilseed Processors Association will release its next weekly oilseed crush report after 8:30 a.m. EDT (1230 GMT) Monday, the trade group said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The group recently moved to issuing the closely-watched figures each Friday morning. But this week, the NOPA office and Chicago futures markets will be closed that day because of the U.S. Independence Day holiday.</p>
<p>((Washington commodities desk 202 898 8341))</p>
